{"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.096707817229891385,"y":0.069767441713699974,"w":0.12139918009440104,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"w":0.15637860616048177,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.098765429345129829,"y":0.116279069625291,"t":"SECTION 4"},{"h":0.016011980593695907,"c":1,"t":"Over the years, attitudes towards workers have changed considerably. After all, there was a","x":0.10281906893325185,"y":0.14277415410560823,"w":0.72439860026041669},{"t":"time when workers had no rights at all, and laboured in appalling conditions. Conditions have","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.10082304299034557,"w":0.73662551879882809,"y":0.15988372081022906},{"y":0.174322732730257,"t":"improved a lot, but conflict in the workplace is still common. And human resources managers","c":1,"w":0.73868311564127598,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.098765438110103604},{"t":"nowadays need to be able to deal with it when necessary.","y":0.19040697697025477,"x":0.10082306273312236,"c":1,"w":0.45884770711263012,"h":0.013081394460653373},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.098765431730364339,"y":0.21366279057665993,"t":"What is conflict in the workplace? Definitions vary, but I'm taking it to refer to a whole range","w":0.72427983601888024,"c":1},{"t":"Q31","x":0.85185185276403863,"w":0.037037035624186143,"y":0.21220930260615589,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1},{"t":"of behaviours that the victim finds unacceptable, from minor, harmless arguments to - at the","h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"y":0.22965116268451036,"w":0.73456792195638021,"x":0.10082303480310306},{"x":0.098765430815570307,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"opposite extreme - physical violence. Much of this is covered by the term bullying, by which","y":0.24411071846243571,"w":0.73045267740885411,"c":1},{"w":0.71824371337890625,"h":0.016163741741921811,"x":0.10075910952980527,"c":1,"t":"I mean one or more people behaving abusively or aggressively against another who is in a","y":0.2585524809905857},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.27470930220447298,"x":0.10082303865461616,"t":"weaker position. Although all behaviour like this is a form of conflict, not all conflict can be","w":0.70987655639648439},{"y":0.29098850022844958,"t":"described in these terms.","x":0.10272906917845499,"h":0.012836465285158472,"c":1,"w":0.2019659169514974},{"w":0.69762161254882815,"x":0.10282616774390856,"t":"As with all human behaviour, there are numerous reasons for it. But often it's caused by_","h":0.014528284645754508,"y":0.31322366900966347,"c":1},{"x":0.85390946593276307,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"t":"Q32","y":0.31250000028057445},{"x":0.10066605762611668,"y":0.32617219332320313,"w":0.74514795939127598,"h":0.021540636168211336,"c":1,"t":"someone who feels the need to show their superiority over someone else, in order to feel that"},{"h":0.016967581916332852,"w":0.51864664713541664,"y":0.34360976545020305,"t":"they aren't at the lowest level in a hierarchy or a group of people.","c":1,"x":0.10074786709075131},{"h":0.016127190404561675,"y":0.36656772254183911,"t":"In some cases one person simply dislikes the other, on the basis that the personality of one","x":0.10075871328129893,"c":1,"w":0.7264395650227865},{"h":0.017110895913958757,"w":0.73265151977539067,"y":0.38148758104614089,"c":1,"x":0.10074697541404759,"t":"is in some way incompatible with that of the other person. A general habit of optimism in one"},{"x":0.10281420011642553,"t":"person could make them intolerant of a colleague who's constantly pessimistic - not that that","c":1,"w":0.73881134033203122,"h":0.015425301272119385,"y":0.39738835386849947},{"y":0.41424418579814404,"t":"justifies treating them badly, of course.","c":1,"w":0.31069959004720055,"x":0.10082304610808696,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.70794993082682289,"y":0.43543427930907619,"t":"Some conflicts arise when people are more interested in promoting themselves and their","x":0.10075332796940453,"c":1,"h":0.017274711662804698},{"x":0.85390946563698089,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.43604651146947382,"t":"Q34"},{"x":0.10082304318083288,"w":0.73662551879882809,"y":0.45200235587513549,"c":1,"h":0.014567411690072807,"t":"team than in the company as a whole. These conflicts are called 'structural\", and could come"},{"y":0.46643852109388129,"t":"about, for example, when a sales team believe they are the only people in the business who","c":1,"x":0.10072914191058137,"w":0.7326904805501302,"h":0.018205302342930496},{"t":"do any useful work, and look down on behind-the-scenes administrators.","y":0.48264978677774417,"w":0.58035888671874991,"h":0.016056904382784287,"x":0.10075967151843496,"c":1},{"x":0.1008230503061074,"w":0.74485595703125007,"t":"Conflict obviously affects the individuals concerned - the situation is likely to be very stressful","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"y":0.50581395335329826},{"y":0.50581395332993906,"t":"Q35","w":0.037037035624186254,"x":0.85596707879284506,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"x":0.10082303581436293,"t":"for victims, resulting in their absence from work, possibly for months. For the company, if no","y":0.52179034161385995,"w":0.72839508056640623,"h":0.01454686781542891,"c":1},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"effort is made to deal with conflict, it can spiral out of control, and even lead to the breakdown","x":0.104938278907757,"w":0.73868311564127609,"y":0.53621908136943641},{"c":1,"x":0.10266847994449482,"y":0.55340414082776113,"w":0.13009618123372396,"t":"of the business.","h":0.013556106351710895},{"y":0.57283096321298876,"x":0.10274476050926835,"t":"Some interesting work with chief executives - CEOs - has uncovered some of the reasons","w":0.72247105916341148,"c":1,"h":0.019531363452421679},{"w":0.70596104939778648,"t":"why they may treat colleagues badly. Many CEOs combine two opposing characteristics:","x":0.10277237793031058,"h":0.018126078853899275,"c":1,"y":0.58958197195847339},{"t":"Q36","h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"x":0.85596707901918268,"y":0.59011627882139972},{"t":"confidence - that is, the belief that they're capable of great achievements - with a high level","c":1,"y":0.60600706731519605,"w":0.73456792195638021,"x":0.10082303614562459,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"c":1,"t":"of anxiety, a fear of missing targets, whether set by themselves or by the directors of the","y":0.62046542187668796,"h":0.018592510964760889,"x":0.10276417316672053,"w":0.69981562296549482},{"c":1,"t":"company. This combination can make them respond badly to anyone who questions their","x":0.10280823911599915,"w":0.71001434326171875,"h":0.016320518385816385,"y":0.63658049560291818},{"y":0.65552325567872216,"c":1,"w":0.086419754028320306,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"decisions.","x":0.10288065784848027},{"t":"In a high pressure work environment, such characteristics become problematic. And it's","w":0.69353342692057285,"c":1,"x":0.10488222138748711,"y":0.67504066915162764,"h":0.015628103653870684},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Q37","x":0.85596707741924016,"y":0.67587209286722738,"w":0.039094651540120484},{"t":"particularly difficult to tackle the situation where colleagues, managers and board members","x":0.10288065811035342,"y":0.69186046498146292,"c":1,"w":0.72427983601888024,"h":0.014558851648696858},{"c":1,"x":0.10280697574517726,"t":"are all trying to achieve their own visions. When they can't agree on strategic issues and on","y":0.70616212616501606,"w":0.72853429158528649,"h":0.016508674172265536},{"t":"where they see the business going, there are real problems.","c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.47942387898763023,"y":0.72232037712928343,"x":0.10493827087141123},{"y":0.74558303882671928,"w":0.71604939778645837,"x":0.10493826403385743,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"For managers at lower levels within the organisation, it might seem that an autocratic form"},{"t":"of management - where the chief executive gives orders and everyone else has to obey -","y":0.7605726107305959,"h":0.014314147131462729,"x":0.10489361914975177,"w":0.71613459269205726,"c":1},{"t":"would see more conflict than others. Interestingly, though, a company with a more democratic Q38","x":0.10288064779012301,"y":0.77616279054923931,"c":1,"w":0.79218109130859382,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"w":0.74289947509765619,"c":1,"h":0.016265596180838338,"t":"business model, can suffer more, when uncertainty about who to report to leads to conflicting","x":0.10282385004961601,"y":0.79058143706496486},{"x":0.10275608075183063,"y":0.80917966596056767,"w":0.084611295064290354,"h":0.013908109900808152,"t":"demands.","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Now I'll say a little about dealing with the type of conflict that has harmful effects. Of course","y":0.82912534443658048,"w":0.72439626057942708,"x":0.10282477544115352,"h":0.017055237391531364},{"t":"the ideal is to prevent it arising in the first place. A good manager, at any level, will make.","x":0.10288066906132144,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.70781890869140629,"c":1,"y":0.84593023242414411},{"c":1,"x":0.85802469196762121,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.84593023241944743,"t":"Q39"},{"h":0.015595272095661139,"w":0.7408317565917969,"t":"efforts to earn the respect of the people they work with, particularly those who report to them.","c":1,"y":0.86087868747074181,"x":0.10488201654003547},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"x":0.10699588445305835,"t":"That will involve politeness in all communications, and treating them as equals who happen","y":0.87632508817779564,"w":0.72427983601888024},{"x":0.10485803781607107,"w":0.37051485697428382,"t":"to have a different role within the organisation.","y":0.89227955782753965,"h":0.014601376087561624,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"104","x":0.10493827221453486,"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.94331395333234358},{"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.2082209142049154,"x":0.39483721545198913,"y":0.96768258519867956,"h":0.016453971009091628,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3395}